/* Pure frontend prototype. No server, account, CMS or upload persistence. */
const articles=[
{"id":"understand-the-code","category":"前端开发","color":"","title":"从“能运行”，到真正理解代码","desc":"一次功能实现之后，如何通过阅读、调试和复盘，把 AI 写出的代码变成自己的经验。","date":"示例文章","read":"3 分钟","intro":"功能可以运行，是一个开始。这篇示例讨论如何把一次实现变成一次学习：先理解代码的边界，再用观察和验证建立自己的判断。","sections":[["trace","先沿着一次操作走一遍"],["verify","用小问题验证理解"],["review","把过程留下来"]],"body":"<h2 id=\"trace\">先沿着一次操作走一遍</h2><p>打开一段陌生代码，先不急着逐行翻译。选择一个具体操作，例如点击“下一篇”，从事件入口开始，找到它读取的状态、调用的函数，以及最后改变的页面内容。</p><p>可以画一条很短的路径：输入是什么，状态在哪里，结果在哪里出现。遇到不理解的函数，先记下它负责什么，再继续沿这条路径读。这样比同时追踪所有分支更容易建立整体印象。</p><h2 id=\"verify\">用小问题验证理解</h2><p>给自己提出几个可以观察的问题：如果列表为空会怎样？连续点击两次，状态是否一致？离开页面后，计时器还在运行吗？通过日志、断点或小范围测试，把猜测和实际行为放在一起比较。</p><p>当结果与预期不同，先缩小问题，再修改代码。请 AI 解释一个函数时，也可以要求它说明输入、输出与边界条件，然后亲自检查这些解释是否成立。</p><aside class=\"callout\">“我知道这一行做什么”和“我知道为什么需要这一行”，是两种不同的理解。</aside><h2 id=\"review\">把过程留下来</h2><p>完成之后，写下一小段复盘：最初的问题、关键选择、遇到的边界，以及现在仍不确定的地方。再尝试不看原解释，用自己的话讲一遍。</p><p>这篇文章是阅读样式与内容组织的示例，不对应作者某次真实项目经历。方法是否适合，还需要在具体任务中检验。</p>"},
{"id":"connect-the-notes","category":"学习方法","color":"pink","title":"把零散笔记，整理成知识地图","desc":"用分类、章节与问题之间的联系，让记录不只是保存下来，也能在需要时重新找到。","date":"示例文章","read":"3 分钟","intro":"整理笔记不必从一套庞大的目录开始。这个示例从几个能重新找到答案的入口出发，让一条条记录逐渐形成联系。","sections":[["entry","给每条记录一个入口"],["connections","连接问题，而不只是分类"],["return","为下次回来留下线索"]],"body":"<h2 id=\"entry\">给每条记录一个入口</h2><p>一条笔记可以很短，但标题最好能回答：什么时候会需要它？与其只写“学习记录”，不如写下当时正在解决的问题，让未来的自己更容易识别。</p><p>先保留少量清晰的分类，例如前端、计算机基础和学习方法。分类承担导航的作用，不必把每一种情况都预先安排好。</p><h2 id=\"connections\">连接问题，而不只是分类</h2><p>当几条记录开始讨论同一个主题，可以整理成章节。章节顺序可以沿着理解过程展开：先是为什么，再是如何工作，最后是常见边界与实际例子。</p><p>在正文中补充相关笔记的联系，比重复复制整段内容更有帮助。一条链接旁边写明关联原因，例如“这里继续讨论状态变化”，读者就知道接下来能看到什么。</p><aside class=\"callout\">目录帮助找到入口，联系帮助理解入口之间的关系。</aside><h2 id=\"return\">为下次回来留下线索</h2><p>每篇结尾保留三个简短问题：已经理解了什么，还有什么不确定，下一步从哪里开始。资料来源、例子和未解决的问题，也都可以成为重新进入主题的线索。</p><p>这是一篇知识整理方法的示例。目录可以随着内容生长调整，不需要一次设计成永远不变的结构。</p>"},
{"id":"notice-the-everyday","category":"生活随记","color":"pink","title":"在普通的一天里，留下一点观察","desc":"记录工作之外的小事、想法和感受，不急着得出结论，让日常也有值得回看的片段。","date":"示例文章","read":"2 分钟","intro":"有些文字不承担解释问题的任务，只是为一个细节留出位置。这篇随记示例谈谈如何从日常观察开始记录。","sections":[["notice","先写看见了什么"],["thought","给感受一点空间"],["open","允许文字暂时没有结论"]],"body":"<h2 id=\"notice\">先写看见了什么</h2><p>可以从一个具体细节开始：一页书上的句子、一种光线，或者一件平时没有注意的小事。先把它写清楚，不急着把它变成道理。</p><p>具体的描述能为记忆留下入口。比起“今天不错”，写下是什么让这个片刻与其他时候不同，往往更容易在以后重新想起。</p><h2 id=\"thought\">给感受一点空间</h2><p>接着写一句当时想到的内容。它可以是一个疑问、一点感受，或与另一段阅读产生的联系。文字不需要完整，也不必为了篇幅添上没有发生的情节。</p><aside class=\"callout\">记录可以短一点，观察可以具体一点。</aside><h2 id=\"open\">允许文字暂时没有结论</h2><p>最后可以留下一句未完成的问题。下一次重读时，再看看想法有没有变化。日常记录的价值，也可以只是保存一个看待事物的角度。</p><p>以上是用于展示随记版式的示例文字，不是对作者真实生活事件的陈述。</p>"},
{id:'small-motion',category:'前端开发',color:'',title:'让界面动起来，也让它安静下来',desc:'从指针到人物姿态，聊聊动效、注意力，以及交互的分寸。',date:'2026.10.08',read:'5 分钟',intro:'有趣的交互可以是一句轻轻的问候。更重要的是，读者开始阅读时，它知道什么时候安静下来。',sections:[['why','动效，先回答为什么'],['follow','从指针到目光'],['quiet','给阅读留一点安静'],['media','一段小小的演示']],body:`<h2 id="why">动效，先回答为什么</h2><p>这个示例把交互留在首页的角色附近：目光、头部和上身跟随指针，离开后回到自然姿态。正文保持稳定，不追着鼠标跑。</p><p>动效的目的，是让页面有回应。它不需要在每一个角落都证明自己的存在。</p><h2 id="follow">从指针到目光</h2><p>先把指针与眼睛中心之间的距离转成一个方向，再限制瞳孔的移动幅度。最后，用逐帧插值让转向稍微柔和一些。</p><div class="code-wrap"><span class="code-label">JavaScript · 示例</span><pre><code>const dx = pointer.x - eye.centerX;
const dy = pointer.y - eye.centerY;
const distance = Math.hypot(dx, dy) || 1;
const amount = Math.min(distance / 240, 1);

pupil.x = (dx / distance) * 3 * amount;
pupil.y = (dy / distance) * 2 * amount;</code></pre></div><p>这里的数值只是起点。角色的眼睛尺寸、屏幕大小和素材边缘，都会影响最终感受。</p><h2 id="quiet">给阅读留一点安静</h2><p>当角色离开屏幕，就暂停逐帧更新；当设备没有精确指针，可以用方向按钮调整朝向。当读者开启“减少动态效果”，让角色静静站好，也是一种体贴。</p><aside class="callout">好的交互既包含“发生什么”，也包含“什么时候不发生”。</aside><h2 id="media">一段小小的演示</h2><p>下面是这个网站使用的原创循环场景视频。它由逐帧渲染的曲面与灯光组成，播放器支持暂停、进度控制和移动端全屏。</p><figure><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="原创蓝色场景视频"><source src="/assets/cinema-loop.mp4" type="video/mp4">当前浏览器无法播放此视频。</video><figcaption>原创场景视频 · 离线渲染</figcaption></figure><p>延伸阅读：<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@media/prefers-reduced-motion" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MDN：prefers-reduced-motion</a>。</p>`},
{id:'io-multiplexing',category:'计算机基础',color:'green',title:'I/O 多路复用：从等待到事件',desc:'把 select、poll 和 epoll 放回同一个问题里：如何管理多个连接的等待？',date:'2026.10.06',read:'6 分钟',intro:'多个连接同时存在时，程序未必需要给每个连接安排一个阻塞等待的线程。这篇示例笔记从“就绪通知”开始理解 I/O 多路复用。',sections:[['waiting','为什么要关注等待'],['ready','就绪，不是读取完成'],['epoll','认识 epoll 的两份列表'],['modes','水平触发与边缘触发'],['recap','把概念连起来']],body:`<h2 id="waiting">为什么要关注等待</h2><p>网络程序通常需要等待连接上的数据。I/O 多路复用让程序通过一次等待，了解多个文件描述符中的哪些已经满足感兴趣的条件。</p><p>select、poll 和 epoll 都可以服务于这个目标，但接口和内部管理方式并不相同。这里先建立直观模型，而不把它们简化成绝对的性能排名。</p><h2 id="ready">就绪，不是读取完成</h2><p>收到可读事件，意味着现在适合尝试读取。实际读取仍由应用调用完成；程序还需要正确处理非阻塞读写、连接关闭与错误。</p><figure class="diagram"><div class="diagram-flow"><div class="diagram-node">注册关注<br>文件描述符</div><span class="connector"></span><div class="diagram-node">等待<br>就绪事件</div><span class="connector"></span><div class="diagram-node">处理<br>实际 I/O</div></div><figcaption>概念示意：通知与实际处理是不同步骤。</figcaption></figure><h2 id="epoll">认识 epoll 的两份列表</h2><p>Linux 文档用 interest list 与 ready list 描述 epoll：前者记录关注的文件描述符，后者对应已经就绪、可供应用获取的事件。</p><div class="code-wrap"><span class="code-label">C · 流程示意</span><pre><code>// 省略错误处理，仅演示调用顺序
int epfd = epoll_create1(0);

epoll_ctl(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, fd, &amp;event);
int count = epoll_wait(epfd, events, max_events, -1);

// 根据返回的事件，执行相应的读写操作</code></pre></div><h2 id="modes">水平触发与边缘触发</h2><p>水平触发（默认）会在条件仍成立时继续通知。边缘触发关注就绪状态的变化，使用时通常需要非阻塞文件描述符，并持续读写直到返回 EAGAIN，以避免遗漏后续处理机会。</p><aside class="callout">不要把“收到了事件”等同于“已经取走了全部数据”。</aside><h2 id="recap">把概念连起来</h2><p>先理解“注册、等待、处理”的分工，再去比较各个接口如何维护集合、返回事件，学习会更容易形成结构。</p><p>技术依据：<a href="https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/epoll.7.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Linux man-pages：epoll(7)</a>。本文是简短示例笔记，实际使用应结合接口文档和完整错误处理。</p>`},
{id:'notes-as-map',category:'学习方法',color:'pink',title:'让笔记成为地图，而不只是仓库',desc:'给知识一个目录，给问题一个入口，再给每次理解留下一点线索。',date:'2026.10.03',read:'4 分钟',intro:'把所有东西都保存下来，并不一定等于真正理解。这个示例尝试用问题、章节与连接，把零散记录变得更容易重访。',sections:[['question','从问题开始'],['structure','让目录保持简单'],['revisit','为下一次重访留线索']],body:`<h2 id="question">从问题开始</h2><p>写笔记前，可以先用一句话记下：我到底想解决什么问题？标题不必概括整门学科，只要能让未来的自己知道为什么点进来。</p><aside class="callout">比“网络知识整理”更具体一点：一个程序如何同时等待很多连接？</aside><h2 id="structure">让目录保持简单</h2><p>第一层放主题，第二层放问题。暂时没有内容的章节不必先摆满；一篇完整的小文章，比十个空标题更有用。</p><ul><li>文章保存一次清晰的解释。</li><li>知识库把相关解释组织成路径。</li><li>随记留下还没想透的念头。</li></ul><h2 id="revisit">为下一次重访留线索</h2><p>每篇笔记结尾补上一点上下文：用到了哪些资料，还有什么不确定，下一次该从哪里接着看。这样，重新进入一个主题时，不必从零开始。</p>`},
{id:'css-variables',category:'前端开发',color:'',title:'用 CSS 变量，收好一个网站的颜色',desc:'把散落的色值整理成小小的一组约定，让页面修改变得更从容。',date:'2026.09.28',read:'3 分钟',intro:'一个页面不需要很多颜色。先给颜色命名，再让它们各司其职，是一个容易开始的整理方式。',sections:[['roles','先定义角色'],['variables','把约定写进变量'],['contrast','最后检查可读性']],body:`<h2 id="roles">先定义角色</h2><p>比起从几十个色值开始，不妨先划分背景、正文、辅助文字、边界和强调色。这些名字描述用途，也让后续调整更容易理解。</p><h2 id="variables">把约定写进变量</h2><pre><code>:root {
  --sky: #eaf5ff;
  --ink: #20324a;
  --muted: #65778c;
  --accent: #2561b7;
}

.article-title { color: var(--ink); }
a { color: var(--accent); }</code></pre><p>先让一个组件使用这组变量，再逐步扩展。没有必要一次把所有细节都做成配置。</p><h2 id="contrast">最后检查可读性</h2><p>浅色可以让页面轻盈，但正文仍然需要清晰的对比。不要只靠颜色区分当前状态，也可以加入文字、边框或下划线。</p><p>延伸阅读：<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Using_CSS_custom_properties" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MDN：CSS 自定义属性</a>。</p>`},
{id:'first-notes',category:'生活随记',color:'pink',title:'给普通的一天，留一个小小的空白',desc:'有些记录不需要完整的结论，只要留下当时认真看过的一点细节。',date:'2026.09.25',read:'2 分钟',intro:'这是一篇生活随记的示例。这里可以安放日常观察、阅读碎片，以及还没有长成文章的想法。',sections:[['slow','把速度放慢一点'],['record','留下一小段记录']],body:`<h2 id="slow">把速度放慢一点</h2><p>一段光线，一页书，一句忽然想记下的话。生活随记可以比文章更轻：不必解释所有背景，也不必急着得出结论。</p><h2 id="record">留下一小段记录</h2><p>如果只写三句话，第一句记录看见的，第二句记录想到的，第三句留给下次。短一点，也可以完整。</p><aside class="callout">示例文字，用于预览随记的阅读样式。它不是作者真实经历。</aside>`}
];
const projects=[{id:'personal-blog',title:'蓝色个人小站',type:'前端原型',desc:'把文章、知识与生活，放进一个轻盈、可阅读的小空间。',tags:['HTML','CSS','JavaScript'],art:'blog',body:'这是一个纯前端个人博客示例项目。首页以三维毛毡人物与大字为中心，指针驱动人物的目光与姿态。文章按主题筛选，知识库按章节阅读。',details:['六个栏目，共用一套蓝白视觉语言','三维人物、连续目光与姿态跟随','响应式布局、键盘导航和减少动态效果支持'],note:'当前原型的内容来自本地文件，没有后台、账号、发布管理或服务器保存。'}, {id:'knowledge-notebook',title:'一份有结构的知识笔记',type:'内容设计示例',desc:'用章节目录与页内索引，把一篇篇笔记连成一条学习路径。',tags:['知识整理','阅读体验'],art:'notes',body:'这个示例展示如何组织一个持续增长的专题知识库。章节目录保留主题之间的关系，页内目录帮助读者定位当前问题。',details:['按主题展开或收起章节','文章内跳转与阅读进度高亮','小屏幕独立展开章节与页内目录'],note:'这是展示内容结构的示例项目，不代表已完成的个人履历或研究成果。'}];
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...document.querySelectorAll(s)],main=$('#main');let cleanup=()=>{},currentKey='',motionPaused=false,columnReturnY=0;const reduced=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
const covers={'understand-the-code':'network-fibers.png','connect-the-notes':'sculptural-glass.png','notice-the-everyday':'life-notes.png','small-motion':'cinema-poster.jpg','io-multiplexing':'network-fibers.png','notes-as-map':'sculptural-glass.png','css-variables':'sculptural-glass.png','first-notes':'life-notes.png'};
const cover=a=>'/assets/'+(covers[a.id]||'sculptural-glass.png');
const categories=['全部','前端开发','计算机基础','学习方法','生活随记'];
const chapters=[['01','前端与交互',[['small-motion','让界面动起来'],['css-variables','CSS 变量与颜色']]],['02','计算机基础',[['io-multiplexing','I/O 多路复用']]],['03','学习与整理',[['notes-as-map','让笔记成为地图']]]];
const meta=a=>`<span class="category-label">${a.category}</span><span class="sample-label">示例</span>`;
const rule=(n,en,link,text)=>`<div class="section-rule" data-reveal><span>${n} / ${en}</span>${link?`<a href="${link}">${text}</a>`:''}</div>`;
const filters=c=>`<div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="文章分类">${categories.map(x=>`<button class="filter" data-category="${x}" aria-pressed="${x===c}">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
function imageCard(a,i=0){return `<a class="story-card article-row" href="#/article/${a.id}" data-reveal style="--delay:${i*70}ms"><div class="story-media"><img src="${cover(a)}" alt="${a.category}文章封面，示意图" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><span class="image-corner" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><span class="image-number">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><div class="story-meta">${meta(a)}</div><h3>${a.title}</h3><p>${a.desc}</p><span class="read-meta">${a.date} · ${a.read}</span></a>`}
const galleryArt = [{"title":"Meadow reverie","alt":"草地里的红色软椅与垂柳，梦幻3D场景","src":"/assets/gallery/01-meadow-reverie.webp","author":"Behnam Mohsenzadeh","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-red-bean-bag-chair-sitting-in-the-middle-of-a-field-of-flowers-12c3FvFjuZ8","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Green signal","alt":"黑底荧光绿立方体阵列，数字几何艺术","src":"/assets/gallery/02-green-signal.webp","author":"Logan Voss","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/green-and-black-geometric-abstract-design-cKPR2YgptuM","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Modern sanctuary","alt":"阳光下的黑色现代住宅与庭院，建筑渲染","src":"/assets/gallery/03-modern-sanctuary.webp","author":"Salman Saqib","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-rendering-of-a-modern-house-with-a-pool-93AF-d_y8rI","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Glass garden","alt":"浅蓝背景上的玻璃果实与透明蝴蝶，材质艺术","src":"/assets/gallery/04-glass-garden.webp","author":"Galina Nelyubova","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-glass-apple-with-a-butterfly-on-top-of-it-m-6dYUG36Qg","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Solstice dunes","alt":"金色沙丘上漂浮的发光球体，超现实数字地景","src":"/assets/gallery/05-solstice-dunes.webp","author":"and machines","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-desert-landscape-with-the-sun-setting-vUn5GH6B7Tw","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Violet drift","alt":"浅紫空间里的透明水母形态，3D玻璃艺术","src":"/assets/gallery/06-violet-drift.webp","author":"Muriel Liu","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-flowers-that-are-floating-in-the-air-mBwE6iko8gU","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Prismatic flow","alt":"黑底粉紫蓝层叠丝带，流动抽象雕塑","src":"/assets/gallery/07-prismatic-flow.webp","author":"Milad Fakurian","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-colorful-object-on-a-black-background-KLnyXKDpcKo","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Coral world","alt":"低多边形珊瑚礁里的太空探索者，趣味3D场景","src":"/assets/gallery/08-coral-world.webp","author":"A.Rahmat MN","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/astronaut-exploring-a-colorful-coral-reef-underwater-GvBSHL3XztA","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Midnight outpost","alt":"行星下的飞船与微光补给站，电影感科幻场景","src":"/assets/gallery/09-midnight-outpost.webp","author":"Vadim Sadovski","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/astronaut-at-a-dimly-lit-alien-gas-station-MDDQ-SE6Azg","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"},{"title":"Golden orbit","alt":"黑底金色环形金属纹理，流动几何造型","src":"/assets/gallery/10-golden-orbit.webp","author":"Jon Handley","provider":"Unsplash","source":"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-golden-object-with-a-black-background-1Fxa9bOWdv0","license":"Unsplash License","licenseUrl":"https://unsplash.com/license"}];
function artGallery(){return `<section class="art-gallery" aria-labelledby="art-gallery-title"><div class="art-gallery-frame"><header class="art-gallery-heading"><div><p>VISUAL INSPIRATIONS / 10 IMAGES</p><h2 id="art-gallery-title">A different perspective.</h2></div><div class="art-gallery-actions"><button class="art-view-all" type="button">VIEW ALL 10 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></button><button class="art-motion-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Pause artwork motion" aria-pressed="false">PAUSE</button></div></header><div class="art-rows">${[0,1].map(row=>`<div class="art-rail" data-row="${row}" aria-label="艺术灵感，第${row+1}排"><div class="art-track"><div class="art-sequence" data-original>${galleryArt.slice(row*5,row*5+5).map((a,j)=>`<a class="art-card" href="${a.src}" data-art="${row*5+j}" aria-label="查看 ${a.title}"><img src="${a.src}" alt="${a.alt}" width="1240" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="art-card-caption"><span>${String(row*5+j+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>${a.title}</strong><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></span></a>`).join('')}</div></div></div>`).join('')}</div><footer class="art-gallery-caption"><span>艺术图片精选 · 展示示例，非本人项目</span><span class="art-scroll-hint">AUTOPLAY · 10 IMAGES</span></footer></div><dialog class="art-lightbox" aria-labelledby="art-lightbox-title"><div class="art-lightbox-top"><span class="art-lightbox-count"></span><button type="button" class="art-lightbox-close" aria-label="关闭图片">CLOSE ×</button></div><figure><img alt=""><figcaption><h3 id="art-lightbox-title"></h3><p class="art-lightbox-credit"></p></figcaption></figure><div class="art-lightbox-controls"><button type="button" data-art-step="-1" aria-label="上一张图片">PREVIOUS</button><span>艺术图片示例</span><button type="button" data-art-step="1" aria-label="下一张图片">NEXT</button></div></dialog></section>`}
function aboutStage(){return `<section class="about-stage" aria-labelledby="about-stage-title" lang="en"><div class="about-objects" aria-hidden="true">${['moon','brick','smile','cursor'].map(name=>`<div class="about-object about-object-${name}"><img src="/assets/about/glass-${name}.png" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="about-stage-content"><h2 id="about-stage-title">ABOUT ME</h2><p class="about-statement">I’m a developer who loves turning ideas into things you can use. This is where I share what I build, what I learn, and the moments I want to remember. From code and side projects to everyday discoveries, I’m always curious about what comes next.</p><a class="about-stage-link" href="#/about">MORE ABOUT ME</a></div></section>`}
function articleNumeral(n){const zero='<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M49 1C16-2 1 15 0 48C-1 81 13 99 46 100C79 102 95 84 96 51C97 19 83 2 49 1ZM47 31C38 31 37 39 37 51C37 64 39 71 47 71C55 71 58 64 58 50C58 37 55 31 47 31Z"/>';const figures={1:'<path d="M104 10L160 1V99H120V37L104 40Z"/>',2:'<path d="M105 12Q123-1 145 1Q181 0 187 24Q192 42 175 57L153 74H189V99H104V76L145 43Q156 34 145 29Q130 27 105 42Z"/>',4:'<path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M151 2H188V59H195V83H188V100H153V83H102V55L130 2H164L137 58H153V26Z"/>',3:'<path d="M105 9Q128-1 150 1Q181 1 187 22Q193 41 174 48Q195 54 191 75Q187 100 151 101Q124 102 104 91V64Q128 77 145 75Q159 74 151 64L133 63L137 41Q155 42 151 32Q139 25 105 39Z"/>'};return `<svg viewBox="0 0 192 102" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor">${zero}${figures[n]}</svg>`}
const columns=[
{id:'frontend',name:'前端开发',intro:'从代码到界面，理解每一次交互如何发生。',articleIds:['understand-the-code','small-motion','css-variables'],images:[1,6,9],order:1},
{id:'computer-science',name:'计算机基础',intro:'沿着一个个问题，读懂程序背后的工作方式。',articleIds:['io-multiplexing'],images:[7,4,8],order:2},
{id:'learning',name:'学习方法',intro:'把阅读、笔记与复盘，连成可以重访的路径。',articleIds:['connect-the-notes','notes-as-map'],images:[5,6,3],order:3},
{id:'everyday',name:'生活随记',intro:'为细小的发现留一个位置，让日常有迹可循。',articleIds:['notice-the-everyday','first-notes'],images:[2,4,0],order:4}
].sort((a,b)=>a.order-b.order);
const columnArticles=c=>c.articleIds.map(id=>articles.find(a=>a.id===id)).filter(Boolean);
function columnMosaic(c){return `<div class="column-mosaic">${c.images.map((index,i)=>{const a=galleryArt[index];return `<img class="column-image column-image-${i}" src="${a.src}" alt="${i===2?c.name+'专栏的艺术示意：'+a.alt:''}" width="1240" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async">`}).join('')}</div>`}
function columnsStage(){return `<section class="columns-stage" aria-labelledby="columns-title"><header class="columns-heading"><h2 id="columns-title">COLUMNS</h2><p>四个方向，慢慢展开。</p></header><div class="column-stack">${columns.map((c,i)=>`<span class="column-anchor" id="column-${c.id}" aria-hidden="true"></span><article class="column-panel" style="--column-i:${i}" aria-labelledby="column-title-${c.id}" data-column="${c.id}"><header class="column-panel-head"><span class="column-number" aria-hidden="true">${articleNumeral(i+1)}</span><div class="column-copy"><h3 id="column-title-${c.id}">${c.name}</h3><p>${c.intro}</p><span>${columnArticles(c).length} 篇示例文章</span></div><a class="column-enter" href="#/column/${c.id}">进入专栏 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>${columnMosaic(c)}<footer class="column-panel-caption"><span>示例专栏 · 艺术图片示意</span><span>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / ${String(columns.length).padStart(2,'0')}</span></footer></article>`).join('')}</div></section>`}
function columnDirectory(id){const c=columns.find(c=>c.id===id);if(!c)return notfound();const list=columnArticles(c),credit=[...new Set(c.images)].map(i=>galleryArt[i]);return `<section class="column-directory"><header class="column-directory-head"><a class="column-back" href="#/" data-columns-back>← 返回首页专栏</a><p class="column-kicker">COLUMN ${String(c.order).padStart(2,'0')} / 示例专栏</p><h1>${c.name}</h1><p class="column-directory-intro">${c.intro}</p><span class="column-directory-count">${list.length} 篇示例文章</span></header><div class="column-directory-art">${columnMosaic(c)}</div><section class="column-directory-list" aria-label="${c.name}文章目录"><h2>专栏目录</h2>${list.map((a,i)=>`<a class="column-directory-row" href="#/article/${a.id}"><span class="column-article-no">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h3>${a.title}</h3><p>${a.desc}</p><small>${a.read} · 示例文章</small></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>`).join('')}</section><details class="column-credits"><summary>封面图片来源与许可</summary><p>图片用于专栏艺术示意，并非本人项目或摄影作品。</p>${credit.map(a=>`<p><a href="${a.source}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${a.title} — ${a.author} / Unsplash</a></p>`).join('')}<a href="https://unsplash.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Unsplash License</a></details><nav class="column-directory-nav" aria-label="其他专栏">${columns.filter(x=>x.id!==id).map(x=>`<a href="#/column/${x.id}">${x.name} ↗</a>`).join('')}</nav></section>`}
function articleIndex(){return `<section class="article-index" aria-labelledby="article-index-title"><div class="article-sky" aria-hidden="true"><img class="article-stars" src="/assets/article-sky/stars.webp" alt="" width="2400" height="1350" loading="lazy"><div class="article-nebula"><img src="/assets/article-sky/milky-way.webp" alt="" width="2400" height="1350" loading="lazy"></div></div><h2 id="article-index-title">ARTICLE</h2><div class="article-index-list">${articles.slice(0,3).map((a,i)=>`<a class="article-index-row" href="#/article/${a.id}" data-reveal><span class="article-index-number" aria-hidden="true">${articleNumeral(i+1)}</span><div class="article-index-copy"><h3>${a.title}</h3><p>${a.desc}</p><span class="article-index-meta">${a.category} · ${a.read} · 示例文章</span></div></a>`).join('')}</div><div class="article-index-footer"><a href="#/articles">浏览全部文章</a></div></section>`}
function home(){return `<div class="magazine-home"><section class="collectible-hero" aria-labelledby="collectible-title" data-current="green" data-playback="loading"><nav class="collectible-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#/about">ABOUT ME<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><div><a href="#/articles">NOTES</a><a href="#/projects">PROJECTS</a><a href="#/life">LIFE</a></div></nav><h1 id="collectible-title"><span>ALWAYS</span><span>CURIOUS.</span></h1><div class="collectible-crop"><div class="collectible-stage" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Three felt portraits. Use left and right arrow keys to switch."><div class="collectible-parallax"><figure class="collectible-figure" data-look="green" data-slot="center"><img src="/assets/trio/felt-green-peace.png" alt="Green felt outfit, arms raised in two peace signs" width="1024" height="1536" fetchpriority="high" draggable="false"></figure><figure class="collectible-figure" data-look="pink" data-slot="right"><img src="/assets/trio/felt-pink-hoodie.png" alt="Pink felt hoodie, both arms raised" width="1024" height="1536" fetchpriority="high" draggable="false"></figure><figure class="collectible-figure" data-look="blue" data-slot="left"><img src="/assets/trio/felt-blue-pointing.png" alt="Blue felt streetwear, one hand pointing forward" width="1024" height="1536" fetchpriority="high" draggable="false"></figure></div></div></div><div class="collectible-bottom"><a class="collectible-intro" href="#/articles">A LITTLE CODE.<br>A LOT OF CURIOSITY.<span>READ MY NOTES →</span></a><div class="collectible-controls" aria-label="Portrait carousel controls"><div class="look-progress" aria-label="Choose a portrait"><button data-select="0" aria-label="Show green outfit" aria-pressed="true"><span></span></button><button data-select="1" aria-label="Show pink outfit" aria-pressed="false"><span></span></button><button data-select="2" aria-label="Show blue outfit" aria-pressed="false"><span></span></button></div><div class="look-actions"><span class="look-count" aria-hidden="true">01 / 03</span><button data-step="-1" aria-label="Previous portrait">←</button><button data-step="1" aria-label="Next portrait">→</button><button class="look-toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause automatic rotation"><span aria-hidden="true">||</span><span class="toggle-label">PAUSE</span></button></div><span class="look-status" aria-live="off">THREE SIDES. ONE ME.</span></div></div><p class="collectible-error" role="status" hidden>Portraits are unavailable. You can still explore the notes below.</p></section>
${artGallery()}
${aboutStage()}
${articleIndex()}
${columnsStage()}</div>`}
function articleList(category='全部'){const list=category==='全部'?articles:articles.filter(a=>a.category===category);return `<section class="archive-head section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE READING ROOM</p><h1>阅读室<span>。</span></h1><div><p>技术、学习与日常观察。<br>每一篇，都是一个问题的切面。</p><span class="archive-count">${String(list.length).padStart(2,'0')}<small>篇示例文章</small></span></div></section><section class="archive-content section-wrap">${filters(category)}<div class="archive-grid">${list.map(imageCard).join('')||'<p class="empty">这个分类还没有文章。</p>'}</div></section>`}
function sidebar(id){return `<aside class="chapter-sidebar" id="chapters" aria-label="知识库章节"><a class="sidebar-home" href="#/knowledge">知识库 / INDEX</a>${chapters.map(([n,t,items])=>`<details open><summary>${n} · ${t}</summary>${items.map(([aid,title])=>`<a href="#/knowledge/${aid}" ${aid===id?'aria-current="page"':''}>${title}</a>`).join('')}</details>`).join('')}</aside>`}
function reading(id,knowledge=false){const a=articles.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!a)return notfound();const sampleStory=['understand-the-code','connect-the-notes','notice-the-everyday'].includes(a.id);const toc=a.sections.map(([id,t])=>`<a href="#${id}" data-anchor="${id}">${t}</a>`).join('');const next=articles[(articles.indexOf(a)+1)%articles.length];return `<header class="reading-cover ${sampleStory?'sample-reading-cover':''} ${a.id==='first-notes'?'light-cover':''}"><img src="${cover(a)}" alt="文章封面，示意图" width="1536" height="1024"><div class="reading-cover-content"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="#/">首页</a><span>/</span><a href="${knowledge?'#/knowledge':'#/articles'}">${knowledge?'知识库':'文章'}</a><span>/</span><span>${a.category}</span></div><p class="eyebrow">${knowledge?'KNOWLEDGE / CHAPTER':'JOURNAL / ARTICLE'} · 示例</p><h1>${a.title}</h1><div class="read-meta">${a.date} · ${a.read}</div></div><span class="cover-index" aria-hidden="true">${String(articles.indexOf(a)+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></header><div class="reading-shell ${sampleStory?'sample-reading':''} ${knowledge?'with-chapters':''}"><div class="reading-mobile">${knowledge?'<button class="chapter-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="chapters">章节目录</button>':''}<details class="mobile-toc"><summary>本文目录</summary><div>${toc}</div></details></div>${knowledge?sidebar(id):''}<article class="reading-main"><div class="article-header"><p class="article-intro">${a.intro}</p><div class="meta">${meta(a)}</div></div><div class="prose">${a.body}</div><nav class="reading-footer" aria-label="文章翻页"><a href="#/${knowledge?'knowledge':'articles'}">返回${knowledge?'知识库':'文章列表'}</a><a href="#/${knowledge?'knowledge':'article'}/${next.id}">下一篇<br><strong>${next.title}</strong></a></nav></article><aside class="toc" aria-label="本文目录"><h2>IN THIS ARTICLE</h2>${toc}</aside></div>`}
function projectList(){return `<section class="project-intro section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">03 / SELECTED EXPERIMENTS</p><h1>小小的尝试。<br><em>真实的过程。</em></h1><p>这里展示原型与内容设计示例。<br>从想法，到结构，再到可以体验的细节。</p></section><div class="exhibit-list">${projects.map((p,i)=>`<a class="full-exhibit ${i?'dark-exhibit':''}" href="#/project/${p.id}"><div class="full-exhibit-art" data-reveal><img src="/assets/${i?'network-fibers.png':'sculptural-glass.png'}" alt="${p.title}的展览示意图" width="1536" height="1024"><span>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><div class="full-exhibit-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">${p.type} / 示例项目</p><h2>${p.title}</h2><p>${p.desc}</p><div>${p.tags.map(t=>`<span>${t}</span>`).join('')}</div><strong>进入展览 <i aria-hidden="true">＋</i></strong></div></a>`).join('')}</div>`}
function projectDetail(id){const p=projects.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!p)return notfound();const image=id==='personal-blog'?'sculptural-glass.png':'network-fibers.png';return `<article class="project-case"><header class="case-cover"><img src="/assets/${image}" alt="项目概念封面，示意图" width="1536" height="1024"><div><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="#/projects">项目展览</a><span>/</span><span>示例项目</span></div><p class="eyebrow">${p.type}</p><h1>${p.title}</h1><p>${p.desc}</p></div><span class="case-big-no" aria-hidden="true">${id==='personal-blog'?'01':'02'}</span></header><section class="case-section section-wrap"><span class="chapter-kicker">01 / THE IDEA</span><div><h2>先把问题说清楚。</h2><p>${p.body}</p><aside class="callout">${p.note}</aside></div></section><section class="case-detail-band"><div class="section-wrap case-section"><span class="chapter-kicker">02 / THE STRUCTURE</span><div><h2>从整体，到每一个细节。</h2><div class="case-points">${p.details.map((d,i)=>`<div data-reveal><span>0${i+1}</span><h3>${d}</h3></div>`).join('')}</div></div></div></section><section class="case-section section-wrap"><span class="chapter-kicker">03 / THE EXPERIENCE</span><div><h2>让界面回应每一次探索。</h2><p>${id==='personal-blog'?'人物由独立三维网格与关节组成。移动指针可以改变视线、头部和上身朝向；文章正文保持稳定。':'章节保留主题的上下文，页内目录帮助定位具体问题。桌面并排阅读，小屏幕按需展开。'}</p><a class="solid-action" href="${id==='personal-blog'?'#/':'#/knowledge'}">${id==='personal-blog'?'体验首页':'进入知识库'}</a></div></section></article>`}
function life(){return `<section class="life-archive section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">04 / LIFE BETWEEN THE LINES</p><h1>日常，<em>也有回声。</em></h1><div class="life-archive-grid"><figure data-reveal><img src="/assets/life-notes.png" alt="笔记本与玻璃杯，生成示意图" width="1122" height="1402"><figcaption>01 / 窗边 · 生成示意图</figcaption></figure><article class="life-entry" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">片段 01 / 示例随记</span><h2>普通的一天，<br>也值得被记住。</h2><p>一段光线，一页书，一句忽然想记下的话。生活随记可以短一点，轻一点，把还没长成文章的想法先放在这里。</p><a class="text-action" href="#/article/first-notes">阅读全文 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></a></article><article class="life-entry offset-entry" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">片段 02 / 示例随记</span><h2>给下一次翻开，<br>留一条线索。</h2><p>读完一章，不急着总结全部内容。先记下一句真正想继续想的问题，再把答案交给之后的阅读。</p><p class="quiet-note">文字与图片均为展示阅读方式的示例，不代表真实个人经历。</p></article><figure class="life-detail-photo" data-reveal><img src="/assets/life-notes.png" alt="纸张、光线与玻璃细节，生成示意图" width="1122" height="1402"><figcaption>02 / 纸上的光 · 同一示意图的细节</figcaption></figure></div></section>`}
function about(){return `<section class="about-intro section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">05 / ABOUT THIS LITTLE CORNER</p><h1>记录，是另一种<br><em>认识世界的方式。</em></h1></section><section class="about-spread section-wrap"><div class="about-portrait"><span class="about-big-type" aria-hidden="true">HELLO.</span><img src="/assets/avatar-original.png" alt="已认可的蓝色外套毛毡全身分身" width="1024" height="1536"></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">我的小站</p><h2>技术，知识，<br>还有生活。</h2><p>文章用来展开一个想法，知识库用来整理一条路径，项目用来记录一次尝试。生活随记，则留给不需要急着得出结论的瞬间。</p><div class="about-topics">${categories.slice(1).map(x=>`<span>${x}</span>`).join('')}</div><aside class="callout">这是纯前端原型。文章与项目均标注为示例，没有加入未经确认的姓名、经历或联系方式。场景视频为原创离线渲染；手记图片为生成示意图。</aside></div></section>`}
function notfound(){return `<section class="notfound section-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL DETOUR</p><h1>这一页，<br>还在路上。</h1><a class="solid-action" href="#/articles">回到阅读室</a></section>`}
function setupExperience(){const root=$('.collectible-hero');if(!root)return()=>{};let cancelled=false,dispose=()=>{};import('/collectible.js').then(({mountCollectible})=>{if(cancelled)return;return mountCollectible(root)}).then(fn=>{if(typeof fn==='function'){if(cancelled)fn();else dispose=fn}}).catch(()=>{root.dataset.playback='static';root.querySelector('.look-status').textContent='STATIC PORTRAITS';root.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true)});return()=>{cancelled=true;dispose()}}
function setupGallery(){const root=$('.art-gallery');if(!root)return()=>{};let cancelled=false,dispose=()=>{};import('/gallery.js').then(({mountGallery})=>{if(cancelled)return;return mountGallery(root,galleryArt)}).then(fn=>{if(typeof fn==='function'){if(cancelled)fn();else dispose=fn}});return()=>{cancelled=true;dispose()}}
function setupAboutStage(){const root=$('.about-stage');if(!root)return()=>{};let cancelled=false,dispose=()=>{};import('/about-stage.js').then(({mountAboutStage})=>{if(cancelled)return;return mountAboutStage(root)}).then(fn=>{if(typeof fn==='function'){if(cancelled)fn();else dispose=fn}});return()=>{cancelled=true;dispose()}}
function setupArticleSky(){const root=$('.article-index');if(!root)return()=>{};let cancelled=false,dispose=()=>{};import('/article-sky.js').then(({mountArticleSky})=>{if(cancelled)return;dispose=mountArticleSky(root)}).catch(()=>{root.dataset.revealMode='static'});return()=>{cancelled=true;dispose()}}
function setupColumns(){const root=$('.columns-stage');if(!root)return()=>{};let cancelled=false,dispose=()=>{};import('/columns.js').then(({mountColumns})=>{if(cancelled)return;dispose=mountColumns(root)});return()=>{cancelled=true;dispose()}}
function setupReveal(){const items=$$('[data-reveal]');if(!items.length)return()=>{};if(reduced.matches||motionPaused){items.forEach(e=>e.classList.add('revealed'));return()=>{}}document.documentElement.classList.add('motion-ready');const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('revealed');observer.unobserve(e.target)}}),{threshold:.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -20px 0px'});items.forEach(e=>observer.observe(e));return()=>observer.disconnect()}
function closeMenu(){$('#main-nav').classList.remove('open');$('.menu-toggle').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');$('.menu-toggle').setAttribute('aria-label','打开导航')}
function render(){let raw=location.hash.slice(1)||'/';if(!raw.startsWith('/'))return;let[route='',id='']=raw.slice(1).split('/');try{id=decodeURIComponent(id)}catch{id=''}const previousKey=currentKey;const key=route+'/'+id;if(key===currentKey&&main.children.length)return;currentKey=key;cleanup();let html;switch(route){case'':html=home();break;case'articles':html=articleList(id||'全部');break;case'column':html=columnDirectory(id);break;case'article':html=reading(id);break;case'knowledge':html=reading(id||'io-multiplexing',true);break;case'projects':html=projectList();break;case'project':html=projectDetail(id);break;case'life':html=life();break;case'about':html=about();break;default:html=notfound()}document.body.className=route?(route==='column'?'interior-page column-page':'interior-page'):'collectible-home';main.innerHTML=html;document.title=route?(main.querySelector('h1')?.textContent||'我的小站')+' · 我的小站':'Always Curious — Notes & Experiments';closeMenu();$$('[data-nav]').forEach(a=>{const active=a.dataset.nav===(route==='article'?'articles':route==='project'?'projects':route||'home');if(active)a.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else a.removeAttribute('aria-current')});window.scrollTo({top:!route&&previousKey.startsWith('column/')?(columnReturnY||$('.columns-stage')?.offsetTop||0):0,behavior:'instant'});main.focus({preventScroll:true});document.documentElement.dataset.motion=motionPaused||reduced.matches?'off':'on';const sceneCleanup=setupExperience(),galleryCleanup=setupGallery(),aboutCleanup=setupAboutStage(),skyCleanup=setupArticleSky(),columnsCleanup=setupColumns(),revealCleanup=setupReveal();let tocObserver;if($('.prose')){tocObserver=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{for(const e of entries)if(e.isIntersecting)$$('.toc a').forEach(a=>a.classList.toggle('active',a.dataset.anchor===e.target.id))},{rootMargin:'-10% 0px -60% 0px'});$$('.prose h2').forEach(h=>tocObserver.observe(h));$('.toc a')?.classList.add('active')}cleanup=()=>{sceneCleanup();galleryCleanup();aboutCleanup();skyCleanup();columnsCleanup();revealCleanup();tocObserver?.disconnect()}}
$('.menu-toggle').addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=$('.menu-toggle').getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';$('#main-nav').classList.toggle('open',open);$('.menu-toggle').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));$('.menu-toggle').setAttribute('aria-label',open?'关闭导航':'打开导航')});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){closeMenu();$$('.mobile-toc[open]').forEach(d=>d.open=false)}});document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('.columns-stage .column-enter'))columnReturnY=window.scrollY;const filter=e.target.closest('[data-category]');if(filter){location.hash='/articles/'+(filter.dataset.category==='全部'?'':encodeURIComponent(filter.dataset.category));return}const anchor=e.target.closest('[data-anchor]');if(anchor){e.preventDefault();document.getElementById(anchor.dataset.anchor)?.scrollIntoView({behavior:reduced.matches?'auto':'smooth'});$$('.mobile-toc[open]').forEach(d=>d.open=false);return}const chapter=e.target.closest('.chapter-toggle');if(chapter){const open=chapter.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';chapter.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));$('#chapters').classList.toggle('open',open)}});window.addEventListener('hashchange',render);render();
